flowchart TD
    Start([python cluster_questions.py]) --> CLI{CLI Command?}

    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
    %% CLUSTER COMMAND
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
    CLI -->|cluster| Incremental{--incremental?}

    Incremental -->|Yes| FetchMapped["get_all_mapped_keys()
    ┌──────────────────────────┐
    │ opinion_question_mapping │
    │ repo: paginate all rows  │
    └──────────────────────────┘"]
    FetchMapped --> FetchAll

    Incremental -->|No| FetchAll

    FetchAll["fetch_questions()
    ┌──────────────────────────────┐
    │ court_opinion_repo           │
    │   .get_opinions_with_qa()    │
    │ WHERE q_and_a IS NOT NULL    │
    │ Flatten → ExtractedQuestion  │
    └──────────────────────────────┘"]

    FetchMapped --> FilterUnmapped["Filter out already-mapped
    questions by (opinion_id, idx)"]
    FilterUnmapped --> QCheck

    FetchAll --> QCheck{Questions found?}
    QCheck -->|No| NoQ([No questions — exit])
    QCheck -->|Yes| Embed

    Embed["embed_questions()
    ┌──────────────────────────────┐
    │ OpenAI Embeddings API        │
    │ Batch size: EMBEDDING_BATCH  │
    │ → numpy array (N, dim)       │
    └──────────────────────────────┘"]

    Embed --> Preview{--preview-distances?}
    Preview -->|Yes| DistTable["preview_distances()
    ┌────────────────────────────┐
    │ Cosine distance matrix     │
    │ Print percentile table     │
    │ (helps tune threshold)     │
    └────────────────────────────┘"]
    DistTable --> Done([Exit])

    Preview -->|No| Cluster

    Cluster["cluster_questions()
    ┌─────────────────────────────────┐
    │ Cosine distance matrix          │
    │ AgglomerativeClustering         │
    │   metric=precomputed            │
    │   linkage=average               │
    │   threshold (default 0.20)      │
    │ → cluster labels per question   │
    └─────────────────────────────────┘"]

    Cluster --> Build

    Build["build_review_output()
    ┌─────────────────────────────────┐
    │ For each cluster:               │
    │                                 │
    │  ┌─ generate_canonical_question │
    │  │  CanonicalQuestionAgent      │
    │  │  (PydanticAI + Anthropic)    │
    │  │  → CanonicalQuestion model   │
    │  └──────────────────────────────│
    │                                 │
    │  Build ClusterReviewEntry with  │
    │  ClusterMember list             │
    │  Skip if < min_cluster_size     │
    └─────────────────────────────────┘"]

    Build --> Save["save_review_file()
    ┌──────────────────────────┐
    │ Serialize via model_dump │
    │ Write cluster_review.json│
    └──────────────────────────┘"]

    Save --> Summary["Print summary table
    (top 20 multi-question clusters)"]
    Summary --> Done2([Exit])

    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
    %% COMMIT COMMAND
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
    CLI -->|commit --file| LoadJSON["Load reviewed JSON
    Parse → ClusterReviewEntry models"]

    LoadJSON --> FilterApproved{Any entries with
    needs_review = false?}
    FilterApproved -->|No| NoApproved([No approved clusters — exit])
    FilterApproved -->|Yes| CommitLoop

    CommitLoop["For each approved cluster:"]
    CommitLoop --> Step1

    Step1["1. Get or create subject
    ┌────────────────────────────────────┐
    │ canonical_question_subject_repo    │
    │   .get_or_create_by_name()        │
    │ → CanonicalQuestionSubjectInDB    │
    └────────────────────────────────────┘"]

    Step1 --> Step2["2. Upsert canonical question
    ┌────────────────────────────────────┐
    │ canonical_question_repo            │
    │   .upsert_by_slug()               │
    │ on_conflict: slug                  │
    │ → CanonicalQuestionRecordInDB     │
    └────────────────────────────────────┘"]

    Step2 --> Step3["3. Upsert mappings (per member)
    ┌────────────────────────────────────┐
    │ opinion_question_mapping_repo      │
    │   .upsert_mapping()               │
    │ on_conflict: opinion_id + q_index  │
    │ → OpinionQuestionMappingInDB      │
    └────────────────────────────────────┘"]

    Step3 --> MoreClusters{More clusters?}
    MoreClusters -->|Yes| CommitLoop
    MoreClusters -->|No| CommitDone([Done — clusters committed])

    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
    %% STYLING
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
    classDef db fill:#e8f4f8,stroke:#2196F3,stroke-width:2px
    classDef llm fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#FF9800,stroke-width:2px
    classDef io fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#4CAF50,stroke-width:2px
    classDef decision fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#E91E63,stroke-width:2px

    class FetchAll,FetchMapped,Step1,Step2,Step3 db
    class Embed,Build llm
    class Save,LoadJSON io
    class CLI,Incremental,Preview,QCheck,FilterApproved,MoreClusters decision